   "genre": "definition",
   "response": "Idempotent means doing something twice gives the same result as doing it once. Like pressing an elevator button repeatedly.\n\nWhy care: networks fail and retry. If a payment charge is idempotent, a retry can't double-charge. Design your API endpoints and scripts so re-running them is always safe.",
